d in black  and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a focally pink tan  moderately firm area abutting the inked margin and measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  The remaining tissue is soft and grossly unremarkable  The specimen is entirely submitted to Cassettes GG II  the firm area is in Cassette GG   Resident  SOUHAD YOUNES  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   BREAST  INFERIOR  BIOPSY CAVITY   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2   BREAST  POSTERIOR    THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D  O R  Diagnosis by  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD O R  Staff Pathologist  Ben Zion Pilch  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Rosa Sung Eun Choi  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT  PART B  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA  SENTINEL  1  PART C  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA  SENTINEL  2  PART D  BREAST RIGHT  NEW INFERIOR MARGIN   EXCISION PART E  BREAST  RIGHT  INFERIOR  POSTERIOR DEEP MARGIN    report_end  , Unchecked.
