y  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  08 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 14 07 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm portion of fibroadipose tissue that is inked and sectioned to reveal unremarkable parenchyma  No discrete lesions are identified  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes A F  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  HONGMEI LI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF INFILTRATING CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D  O R  Diagnosis by  ESTHER OLIVA  MD O R  Staff Pathologist  Robert Henry Young  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Ashby Carter Moncure  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
