ing parenchyma and surgical resection margins are submitted serially from superior to inferior in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Christopher William M D   Ph  D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Christopher William M D   Ph  D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Review by Kristina Braaten M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION , Unchecked.
