ng to the deep margin and to the skin surface REMOVED_DATE x 1 9cm and splaying along the deep margin extending to within 1 8cm of the superior margin and 2 2cm of the inferior margin  There are focal cystic areas in the remaining breast parenchyma which is white  pink fibrous breast tissue  The axillary tail is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm  and a suture designates the highest axillary lymph node  There are several small nodules in this area all less than REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  however  no lymph nodes are identified  this area is submitted cassettes A and B entirely  Section Code  A B Highest axillary tissue  C E Representative nodules in the axilla  F I Skin and deep margin of indented fixed area from medial to lateral  J K Representative radial sections of superior margin  L M Representative radial sections of inferior margin  N Nipple and deep margin  O Representative radial section of medial margin  P Representative breast tissue  medial inferior area  Q Representative breast tissue  lateral central area with deep margin  R W  Remaining axillary tissue  entirely submitted   Resident  Mark vanGorder  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
