at approximately 8 o clock to the nipple  within the lower outer quadrant  The mass abuts the anteior margin  is located 1cm to the deep margin and 2 5cm to the inferior margin  Adjacent and superior to the mass is a REMOVED_DATE x 1 x 0 5cm tan white  rubbery area which is ill defined  Also located in the breast  superior to the mass and deep to the nipple  is a 9cm in diameter plastic implant  which contains clear saline  The implant bears the following inscription   McGhan 150 cc   and is easily removed from the adjacent breast tissue  The implant is photographed and is for gross examination only  The cavity lining the implant is tan brown to tan pink and smooth  with adjacent areas of tan white rubbery fibrosis  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is unremarkable  A 0 7cm tan pink lymph node is identified within the axillary region  Representative sections of the specimen are submitted as follows  C D  Representative sections of mass with closest anterior margin  E  Mass with adjacent tan white rubbery area  F  Further representative sections of mass  G  Representative radial sections of deep margin  H  Fibrous tissue adjacent to implant cavity  I  Fibrous tissue away from tumor and implant cavity  J  Axillary lymph node  bisected  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast   is a simple mastectomy measuring REMOVED_DATE x 20 x 3cm  with an anterior REMOVED_DATE x 3 7cm tan skin ellipse  The skin ellipse contains a REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm unremarkable nipple areolar complex  No scars are identified  The skin ellipse contains a short suture designated by the surgeon as superior and a long suture designated by the surgeon as lateral  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior blue  posterior black  It is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm tan white  rubbery  irregular biopsy cavity  which abuts the deep margin  The biopsy cavity is located deep and lateral  approximately 3 o clock   t