f yellow lobulated adipose tissue with focal areas of dense white tan focally nodular fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity  1 to posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity  1 to posterior margin  to include clip site   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity  1 to include clip site   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity  1   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity  2  to skin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity  2   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Uninvolved  upper inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Uninvolved  lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section raised lesion on skin  Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on Thursday August 20   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 04 17 04PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART   Breast  Left   Simple Mastectomy  report_end  , Unchecked.
