D_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 6 5cm nipple sparing simple mastectomy  specimen with a short suture designating the superior margin and a long suture  designating the lateral margin  The anterior margin is inked blue and the  posterior margin is inked black  The upper inner quadrant of the breast shows  an irregularly outlined  tan white  firm to hard  focally gritty  mass measuring  2 0 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm and located 0 2cm from the closest blue inked anterior  margin and 0 4cm from the closest black inked posterior margin  The breast  parenchyma of the upper inner and upper outer quadrants shows diffuse and dense  and focally nodular fibrous stroma with gritty calcifications  extending into  the superior portion of the lower quadrant  It is difficult to distinguish the  mass from the surrounding dense fibrosis  Centrally  the breast parenchyma  shows a firm and focally calcified area with hemorrhage  grossly suggestive of a  previous biopsy site  The breast parenchyma of the upper and the inner outer  quadrants shows another  poorly circumscribed and ill defined  tan white  firm  to hard  focally gritty mass measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm  located 0 5cm from  the closest black inked posterior margin and 2 8cm from the closest blue inked  anterior margin  The breast parenchyma just medial to the mass shows hemorrhage  focally  grossly suggestive of a previous biopsy site  A definite metallic clip  is not identified  The remaining breast parenchyma consists of admixed fatty  tissue and dense pink white fibrous stroma which is nodular  No lymph nodes are  detected in the lateral portion of the specimen  Representative sections are  submitted from medial to lateral in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  as follows      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the 1st mass located in the upper inner  quadrant  with blue inked anterior margin and black inked posterior margin    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma from the upper inner quadrant  late