ion margin which is the closest surgical resection margin F G firm areas of breast approximately 1 0cm deep to the nodule H  firm breast tissue 3 0cm lateral and deep to the lesion I P lymph nodes Resident  Eugene F  Ruffolo  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  Eugene Francis Ruffolo  M D  PART   LEFT MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
